OL,3,GNEWSAThousands to get wheelie bins for
OL,4,Athe first time
OL,5,
OL,6,FWheelie bins have been delivered to a
OL,7,Fpart of Lincolnshire where they have
OL,8,Fnever been used before.
OL,10,FSouth Holland District Council has
OL,11,Fstarted the process of rolling out
OL,12,Fabout 200,000 bins to households across
OL,13,Fthe area, who previously had to
OL,14,Fseparate their waste into bags and
OL,15,Fplace them outside their homes.
OL,17,FTeresa Andrews, 74, said she thought
OL,18,Fthe new bins were "fantastic",
OL,19,Fespecially as animals often raided the
OL,20,Fbags.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
